{"title":"The Surreality of Japanese Playgrounds at Night","link":"https://kottke.org/25/07/the-surreality-of-japanese-playgrounds-at-night","date":1752782560000,"content":"\n        <p>For years now, photographer <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/fujio_panda/\">Fujio Kito</a> has been <a href=\"https://fujio-pand-park.tumblr.com/\">documenting</a> cement playground equipment in Japan, often capturing them at night, lit up in captivating ways.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"800\" alt=\"playground equipment shaped like a robot\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"800\" alt=\"playground equipment shaped like a grasshopper\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1000\" height=\"799\" alt=\"playground equipment shaped like some animals\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/japan-pg-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc